WEBVTT

01:29.310 --> 01:34.380
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.680 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 10]

01:47.950 --> 01:48.479
Zhou Wan.

01:51.890 --> 01:52.890
Thanks for today.

01:53.600 --> 01:54.259
Good night.

01:57.800 --> 01:58.460
Good night.

02:19.250 --> 02:21.250
You've been living here for a while.

02:21.460 --> 02:22.790
How are you settling in?

02:26.340 --> 02:27.800
How is your grandma doing?

02:33.180 --> 02:34.340
I've already prepared

02:34.340 --> 02:35.540
the rest of the money.

02:38.740 --> 02:39.530
Also,

02:39.810 --> 02:41.270
I've asked around for you.

02:41.650 --> 02:42.980
As for the kidney donor,

02:43.180 --> 02:44.970
it can be arranged later.

02:46.300 --> 02:46.940
Look,

02:48.250 --> 02:49.530
I've done everything

02:50.060 --> 02:51.460
I promised you I would do.

02:53.300 --> 02:54.160
What about you?

02:57.740 --> 02:59.340
You're helping Lu Xixiao

02:59.530 --> 03:00.850
with his portfolio.

03:02.180 --> 03:03.500
What are you thinking?

03:04.610 --> 03:06.460
Zhou Wan, I'm coming in.

03:11.740 --> 03:12.670
Why are you here?

03:12.850 --> 03:13.650
It's nothing.

03:13.970 --> 03:15.370
You came back so late.

03:15.370 --> 03:16.829
I was just checking on her.

03:16.940 --> 03:17.970
Get some rest.

03:18.250 --> 03:19.450
Don't stay up so late.

03:19.850 --> 03:20.850
Go to sleep early.

03:21.780 --> 03:22.500
Good night.

03:33.090 --> 03:35.060
I forgot to give you this.

03:36.780 --> 03:37.460
For me?

03:39.940 --> 03:42.460
What about the one for Professor Qin?

03:43.090 --> 03:44.650
This wasn't meant for him.

03:45.020 --> 03:45.850
It's for you.

03:49.970 --> 03:51.300
You painted this for me?

03:52.410 --> 03:52.940
Alright.

03:52.940 --> 03:54.460
It's not a big deal.

03:55.780 --> 03:57.310
What did she just say to you?

03:59.370 --> 04:00.250
Nothing.

04:01.500 --> 04:03.020
She just noticed

04:03.020 --> 04:04.900
I haven't been studying much lately,

04:04.900 --> 04:06.160
so she checked up on me.

04:07.900 --> 04:09.100
She didn't bully you?

04:09.180 --> 04:11.810
No, she's my sponsor.

04:12.570 --> 04:13.410
Why would she?

04:17.180 --> 04:19.910
It's been a while
since I last reviewed properly.

04:20.500 --> 04:21.570
I'll study for a bit.

04:21.570 --> 04:22.830
You should rest early.

04:24.570 --> 04:25.180
Okay.

04:26.210 --> 04:27.210
Go to sleep early.

04:29.810 --> 04:30.410
By the way.

04:31.370 --> 04:33.620
Jiang Fan wants to get together tomorrow.

04:33.620 --> 04:34.690
You go first.

04:35.010 --> 04:35.620
I'll prepare

04:35.620 --> 04:37.280
the things for the professor.

04:38.010 --> 04:38.659
Okay.

05:23.370 --> 05:24.660
Did he hear everything?

05:24.660 --> 05:25.370
No.

05:25.810 --> 05:27.270
What did he come to you for?

05:30.370 --> 05:31.970
It has nothing to do with you.

05:33.540 --> 05:34.659
Why do I feel

05:35.810 --> 05:37.250
that you like Lu Xixiao?

05:38.500 --> 05:40.620
You look more scared than I am.

05:43.810 --> 05:44.860
No wonder.

05:45.100 --> 05:46.210
You like him.

05:46.940 --> 05:48.870
That's why you've been against me.

05:50.500 --> 05:51.500
Take my advice.

05:52.060 --> 05:53.810
Just send him away.

06:04.210 --> 06:05.470
Don't come any closer.

06:05.620 --> 06:07.330
If you come closer, I'll tear it up.

06:07.330 --> 06:08.180
Who drew this?

06:09.250 --> 06:10.060
Who drew it?

06:10.980 --> 06:11.860
He did.

06:12.500 --> 06:13.300
What is it for?

06:17.210 --> 06:17.870
He was going

06:19.330 --> 06:20.860
to give it to Professor Qin.

06:23.370 --> 06:24.830
You really are something.

06:42.940 --> 06:43.740
Just say Ms. Chen

06:43.740 --> 06:45.000
accidentally lost it.

07:22.240 --> 07:25.030
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

07:27.730 --> 07:32.100
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

07:29.890 --> 07:31.330
Is this cooked yet?

07:34.500 --> 07:36.690
What's wrong? You seem distracted.

07:38.540 --> 07:39.470
I don't think so.

07:39.500 --> 07:40.250
You do.

07:40.860 --> 07:42.659
Maybe I'm just too tired lately.

07:45.570 --> 07:47.130
After that night,

07:47.909 --> 07:49.480
did the two of you get together?

07:49.480 --> 07:50.430
No.

07:50.670 --> 07:58.040
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

07:50.860 --> 07:52.300
He just acts on a whim.

07:52.300 --> 07:53.950
He wants us to be together just like that.

07:53.950 --> 07:55.610
We'll be doing long distance.

07:55.740 --> 07:56.300
He needs to give me a

07:56.300 --> 07:57.500
plan for that, right?

07:58.940 --> 08:00.340
So you didn't reject him.

08:00.940 --> 08:03.060
I still like him

08:03.060 --> 08:03.940
a little bit.

08:04.110 --> 08:06.510
So I can't just let him
do whatever he wants.

08:06.890 --> 08:08.290
Really just a little bit?

08:09.010 --> 08:10.010
Just a little bit.

08:15.490 --> 08:17.750
What does it feel like to be confessed to?

08:18.130 --> 08:20.200
Why do you want to know?

08:20.450 --> 08:21.780
I'm a normal person too.

08:22.300 --> 08:23.620
Normal people get slow-witted

08:23.620 --> 08:25.130
when they fall in love.

08:25.300 --> 08:26.330
Didn't I tell you?

08:26.540 --> 08:29.060
The body acts before the heart.

08:32.260 --> 08:33.630
What nonsense is this?

08:34.020 --> 08:36.620
What do you mean
the body acts before the heart?

08:36.669 --> 08:38.470
Why are you eavesdropping on us?

08:38.490 --> 08:40.450
It means I haven't thought it through,

08:40.450 --> 08:42.059
-but I’ll hit you first.
-I brought skewers.

08:42.059 --> 08:43.780
How was I eavesdropping?

08:44.140 --> 08:44.940
I want to eat this too.

08:44.940 --> 08:47.740
-I just happened to walk by...
-There are two more.

08:48.210 --> 08:50.020
Look at you. Don't cause trouble.

08:50.020 --> 08:51.620
Can you stop messing around?

08:58.540 --> 08:59.260
I want this.

09:00.180 --> 09:02.190
This is alcohol. Kids can't drink it.

09:02.190 --> 09:04.360
I... I'm not a kid.

09:04.380 --> 09:05.420
I'm an adult.

09:10.940 --> 09:11.570
Thank you.

09:13.940 --> 09:14.610
For what?

09:15.970 --> 09:17.300
The painting I gave you.

09:18.060 --> 09:20.690
I definitely couldn't
have painted it without you.

09:20.690 --> 09:21.490
Do you like it?

09:26.730 --> 09:27.420
I like it.

09:28.940 --> 09:29.870
Glad you like it.

09:36.970 --> 09:38.770
What's it like to drink alcohol?

09:40.850 --> 09:42.310
It doesn't feel like much.

09:43.450 --> 09:44.730
You just get drunk.

09:45.810 --> 09:46.870
When you're drunk,

09:47.080 --> 09:49.210
you forget all the good and bad things.

09:50.900 --> 09:51.810
We have enough skewers.

09:51.810 --> 09:53.810
Stop grilling and come play inside.

09:55.060 --> 09:56.520
You go inside. I'll grill.

10:06.970 --> 10:08.500
Do you know how? Let me do it.

10:10.490 --> 10:11.730
Ping, just sit there.

10:11.730 --> 10:12.540
I know how.

10:15.180 --> 10:15.910
Want a drink?

10:17.690 --> 10:18.540
For me?

10:19.570 --> 10:20.380
You're already 18.

10:20.380 --> 10:21.380
You can try it.

10:32.990 --> 10:34.720
Don't tell them I gave it to you.

10:35.850 --> 10:36.900
It's so good.

10:37.160 --> 10:37.840
Of course.

10:43.730 --> 10:44.540
Ms. Chen.

10:44.570 --> 10:46.380
These two pieces of clothes are silk.

10:46.380 --> 10:47.290
You have to hand wash them.

10:47.290 --> 10:47.810
Okay.

10:49.810 --> 10:50.540
What's this?

10:51.690 --> 10:52.610
It's Xixiao's.

10:53.730 --> 10:54.900
Where did he go?

10:56.300 --> 10:57.760
I'm not quite sure either.

10:58.810 --> 11:00.940
Wan went with him?

11:03.850 --> 11:04.580
That's good.

11:04.900 --> 11:06.780
He's usually a loner.

11:06.850 --> 11:07.780
Now that Wan is here,

11:07.780 --> 11:09.180
she can keep him company.

11:09.610 --> 11:10.210
Yeah.

11:12.140 --> 11:12.730
Go ahead.

11:16.140 --> 11:16.810
Zhou Wan,

11:17.180 --> 11:18.360
you lied to me.

12:18.300 --> 12:19.330
So pretty.

12:28.090 --> 12:30.790
One, two, three, four, five.

12:30.820 --> 12:33.050
Follow yours...

12:35.300 --> 12:38.300
One, two, three, four, five.

12:38.610 --> 12:41.140
-One, two, three, four, five.
-Did she drink?

12:42.050 --> 12:43.250
Who gave her alcohol?

12:44.280 --> 12:46.420
Who? Who gave her alcohol?

12:46.420 --> 12:48.520
One, two, three, four, five.

12:48.610 --> 12:50.180
-Let us…
-Did you drink?

12:50.210 --> 12:51.200
Did you drink?

12:51.780 --> 12:52.800
You gave her alcohol, didn't you?

12:52.800 --> 12:53.800
You gave it to her?

12:54.420 --> 12:55.260
-Ping, you her alcohol.
-Look at me.

12:55.260 --> 12:55.780
-Right?
-Lu Xixiao.

12:55.780 --> 12:58.440
-No, I'm wearing gloves.
-Lu Xixiao. Lu Xixiao.

12:59.450 --> 13:00.650
Let's do it together.

13:04.300 --> 13:05.330
I picked this song.

13:05.330 --> 13:06.450
But I don't know how to sing it either.

13:06.450 --> 13:07.210
Here you go.

13:07.210 --> 13:08.610
How do you sing this song?

13:19.780 --> 13:20.780
It hurts.

13:27.540 --> 13:28.490
Lu Xixiao,

13:29.140 --> 13:30.210
my leg hurts.

13:48.240 --> 13:49.100
This leg hurts?

13:54.730 --> 13:55.690
Or this?

14:43.820 --> 14:45.020
You really are drunk?

14:48.020 --> 14:49.500
I just feel a little dizzy.

14:52.850 --> 14:53.570
If nothing is wrong,

14:53.570 --> 14:54.970
why did you drink so much?

14:59.070 --> 15:00.680
Because I'm a little sad.

15:03.160 --> 15:04.040
Sad about what?

15:07.970 --> 15:09.590
I did something very bad.

15:11.590 --> 15:12.750
I regret it.

15:15.020 --> 15:17.080
But it seems there is no turning back.

15:20.690 --> 15:21.690
It's like

15:23.420 --> 15:24.900
for one thing,

15:26.900 --> 15:28.140
I gave up everything,

15:33.640 --> 15:35.350
even becoming a bad person.

15:37.900 --> 15:38.690
But in the end,

15:38.690 --> 15:39.820
I might get nothing

15:41.260 --> 15:42.930
and change nothing.

15:46.420 --> 15:47.950
The only thing that changed

15:50.810 --> 15:52.140
is that I became bad.

15:53.570 --> 15:54.970
So what if you become bad.

15:59.060 --> 16:00.520
Don't you hate bad people?

16:02.300 --> 16:03.900
I'm not a good person either.

16:10.310 --> 16:11.510
You are a good person.

16:18.260 --> 16:19.550
Lu Xixiao.

16:19.940 --> 16:22.260
Maybe you don't even realize it yourself.

16:22.260 --> 16:23.690
But you're honest,

16:24.380 --> 16:25.420
kind,

16:27.780 --> 16:28.710
and very gentle.

16:30.610 --> 16:31.180
No matter what,

16:31.180 --> 16:32.910
you would never be a bad person.

16:34.760 --> 16:36.960
Your judgment is pretty terrible then.

16:38.660 --> 16:39.660
How could that be?

16:40.420 --> 16:42.220
Everyone I like is a good person.

16:45.090 --> 16:45.940
You,

16:48.090 --> 16:48.970
Gu Meng...

16:50.780 --> 16:52.780
You're all very good people.

16:54.510 --> 16:55.900
I like you very much.

17:05.730 --> 17:07.000
Talking about this

17:09.400 --> 17:10.770
makes me a little sad.

17:16.290 --> 17:17.900
I'm not a kind person.

17:20.180 --> 17:21.579
So I want to be nice to you.

17:24.099 --> 17:25.140
If I am nice to you,

17:26.869 --> 17:28.300
can I offset

17:28.450 --> 17:30.140
some of my mistakes?

17:34.530 --> 17:35.660
Then I wouldn't be

17:35.660 --> 17:36.690
such a bad person.

17:39.800 --> 17:41.380
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

17:43.450 --> 17:44.730
♪ An astronomer ♪

17:47.760 --> 17:49.290
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

17:51.130 --> 17:53.680
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

17:55.810 --> 17:57.550
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

17:59.310 --> 18:01.380
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

18:02.810 --> 18:05.290
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

18:06.770 --> 18:10.550
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

18:13.730 --> 18:15.010
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

18:15.830 --> 18:17.070
♪ No time left, so I ♪

18:17.700 --> 18:19.740
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

18:21.640 --> 18:24.320
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

18:24.490 --> 18:27.990
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

18:29.790 --> 18:32.080
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

18:32.170 --> 18:35.970
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

18:35.770 --> 18:38.320
Zhou Wan. It's okay if you turn bad.

18:37.760 --> 18:38.990
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

18:38.650 --> 18:40.240
Someone will love you anyway.

18:39.020 --> 18:41.800
♪ This mud all over me ♪

18:42.710 --> 18:45.660
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

18:58.100 --> 18:58.900
Lu Xixiao.

19:04.270 --> 19:05.930
Did you bring your portfolio?

19:06.750 --> 19:08.330
Did you bring your portfolio?

19:08.330 --> 19:08.850
Yes.

19:10.030 --> 19:11.490
You will definitely pass.

19:13.970 --> 19:14.530
What?

19:15.860 --> 19:17.100
You will definitely pass.

19:17.100 --> 19:18.830
Louder. I can't hear you. What?

19:20.010 --> 19:21.470
You will definitely pass!

19:29.140 --> 19:29.870
I'm leaving.

19:49.900 --> 19:50.530
Wan.

19:51.660 --> 19:52.620
Come and see

19:53.450 --> 19:55.310
if these flowers are pretty.

19:55.970 --> 19:57.900
Are they suitable for the wedding?

19:59.530 --> 20:00.860
As long as you're happy.

20:01.690 --> 20:03.620
Is that how you talk to your elders?

20:04.420 --> 20:05.050
Come here.

20:06.210 --> 20:07.810
I have something to tell you.

20:09.490 --> 20:10.180
What?

20:10.940 --> 20:12.130
Are you going to invite me

20:12.130 --> 20:13.240
to your wedding?

20:15.660 --> 20:16.450
Not exactly.

20:17.490 --> 20:18.830
Our deal

20:18.940 --> 20:20.100
is off.

20:20.820 --> 20:22.420
You can move out now.

20:26.530 --> 20:27.390
What did you do?

20:29.490 --> 20:30.660
What did I do?

20:33.050 --> 20:34.820
I just did what

20:35.210 --> 20:36.540
you were supposed to do.

20:47.290 --> 20:49.090
What did you do to the paintings?

20:50.140 --> 20:51.140
Do they look good?

21:00.380 --> 21:01.050
Zhou Wan.

21:01.950 --> 21:02.690
Don't waste time

21:02.690 --> 21:03.940
at the Lu family anymore.

21:03.940 --> 21:05.180
Go study hard.

21:05.270 --> 21:07.140
Let's both live our own lives.

21:07.310 --> 21:08.620
If the portfolio is gone,

21:08.620 --> 21:09.420
Lu Xixiao will definitely know

21:09.420 --> 21:10.320
you did it.

21:12.100 --> 21:13.160
But you don't dare.

21:14.180 --> 21:15.280
What are you trying to do?

21:15.280 --> 21:16.880
You switched the portfolio?

21:21.330 --> 21:22.930
You want him to think I did it?

21:36.860 --> 21:37.580
Stop.

21:38.170 --> 21:39.500
If you walk out that door,

21:39.500 --> 21:41.100
don't ask for money anymore.

21:41.320 --> 21:43.380
Let go. I don't want the money anymore.

21:43.380 --> 21:44.010
Guo Yan.

21:44.490 --> 21:45.870
Our deal is over.

21:47.210 --> 21:48.450
Starting from today,

21:48.580 --> 21:49.490
stop bothering

21:49.490 --> 21:50.660
Grandma and me.

21:50.860 --> 21:52.790
And don't you dare touch Lu Xixiao.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.240
If you dare to stop me,

21:57.770 --> 21:59.830
even if it means ruining everything,

22:00.720 --> 22:01.980
I will expose you.

22:11.970 --> 22:16.310
[Pingchuan Art Masters Joint Exhibition]

22:27.820 --> 22:29.400
Sir, why are we stuck?

22:29.490 --> 22:31.340
I don't know why we're stuck.

22:31.340 --> 22:33.200
Maybe there's an accident ahead.

22:35.450 --> 22:36.900
Here is fine. Thank you.

22:39.680 --> 22:40.200
Miss.

22:46.250 --> 22:47.770
I can't drive my car now.

22:47.770 --> 22:48.860
Fix it for me immediately.

22:48.860 --> 22:50.320
Fix it for me immediately.

22:50.450 --> 22:51.290
Look for yourself.

22:51.290 --> 22:52.750
My car won't run right now.

23:05.920 --> 23:09.780
[The Department of Fine Arts,
Pingchuan University]

23:19.210 --> 23:20.070
Professor Qin.

23:20.900 --> 23:21.860
-You are?
-I’m sorry.

23:21.860 --> 23:22.660
Sorry.

23:22.840 --> 23:23.420
I'm here to deliver

23:23.420 --> 23:24.840
Lu Xixiao's portfolio.

23:24.900 --> 23:26.490
Something happened at home recently,

23:26.490 --> 23:27.290
and when he left,

23:27.290 --> 23:28.420
he took the wrong one by mistake.

23:28.420 --> 23:30.140
But he prepared very carefully.

23:30.140 --> 23:30.730
Look.

23:41.730 --> 23:42.860
Professor Qin, I believe

23:42.860 --> 23:43.990
you can also feel

23:44.250 --> 23:45.940
that his state of mind this time

23:45.940 --> 23:47.820
is quite different from the last time.

23:47.820 --> 23:49.880
He really wants to continue drawing.

23:50.730 --> 23:52.600
Could you please reconsider

23:52.730 --> 23:54.260
and not reject him just yet?

23:55.380 --> 23:56.640
It's indeed very good,

23:57.050 --> 23:59.100
but in many places,

23:59.100 --> 24:00.370
it's a bit too simple.

24:00.860 --> 24:01.860
When he comes out,

24:02.530 --> 24:03.380
I need to have a good talk with him

24:03.380 --> 24:04.580
about this problem.

24:05.660 --> 24:08.180
Comes out? Where did he go?

24:08.620 --> 24:10.950
Before I could look at
the work he brought,

24:11.140 --> 24:12.100
he volunteered to

24:12.100 --> 24:13.340
draw a piece on the spot

24:13.340 --> 24:14.800
and asked for my guidance.

24:15.050 --> 24:16.660
I also wanted to see his

24:16.660 --> 24:18.010
ability to create on the spot

24:18.010 --> 24:19.070
and handle details

24:19.210 --> 24:21.140
before discussing anything else.

24:21.380 --> 24:22.240
I didn't expect

24:22.340 --> 24:23.770
his creative inspiration

24:23.770 --> 24:24.660
to be so rich.

24:24.730 --> 24:26.980
So you didn't reject him?

24:27.380 --> 24:28.180
No.

24:29.250 --> 24:29.970
I thought

24:30.730 --> 24:32.860
I'd decide after he finishes drawing.

24:33.140 --> 24:34.540
That's great. Thank you.

24:35.660 --> 24:37.380
He should be out soon.

24:37.530 --> 24:39.010
Do you want to wait for him?

24:40.580 --> 24:42.240
I have some other things to do.

24:43.100 --> 24:44.430
I won't disturb you two.

24:45.050 --> 24:45.580
Okay.

24:48.050 --> 24:49.850
The technique is well executed.

24:50.660 --> 24:53.490
The emotions come through very strongly.

24:54.900 --> 24:57.530
Maybe even too strong in some places.

24:58.970 --> 25:00.700
You should learn to control it.

25:02.660 --> 25:05.010
This painting seems a bit rushed.

25:10.100 --> 25:10.940
All right.

25:14.250 --> 25:15.400
But still,

25:16.100 --> 25:18.760
thank you for this opportunity,
Professor Qin.

25:20.530 --> 25:22.510
Maybe the time was too tight today,

25:22.580 --> 25:24.510
so you didn't show your true level.

25:24.660 --> 25:25.140
But

25:25.140 --> 25:27.290
the emotional expression in your portfolio

25:27.290 --> 25:28.530
is much richer.

25:29.860 --> 25:31.320
You've seen my portfolio?

25:31.770 --> 25:33.430
I was going to look at it later,

25:33.530 --> 25:35.530
but you might have brought the wrong one.

25:35.530 --> 25:36.900
Someone hurried over

25:36.900 --> 25:37.940
to bring it to you.

25:38.290 --> 25:39.150
Who brought it?

25:39.730 --> 25:40.730
A girl.

25:41.180 --> 25:42.940
She was thin and petite,

25:43.010 --> 25:45.070
and left right after dropping it off.

25:53.620 --> 25:54.350
Where is she?

25:55.970 --> 25:57.010
I heard her mention this morning

25:57.010 --> 25:58.250
that she was going to see her grandma.

25:58.250 --> 26:00.380
She's probably still at the hospital.

26:00.690 --> 26:01.290
Wait.

26:02.450 --> 26:03.250
What is this?

26:03.530 --> 26:04.970
I found it on her desk.

26:05.210 --> 26:07.340
It looks like it's completely ruined.

26:29.140 --> 26:30.140
I couldn't tell

26:30.140 --> 26:31.490
that you liked doing crafts.

26:31.490 --> 26:32.690
Can't you knock before coming in?

26:32.690 --> 26:33.380
I was just afraid of interrupting

26:33.380 --> 26:34.710
the artist's creation.

26:52.940 --> 26:53.820
It's rare

26:53.820 --> 26:55.680
to see a living thing in your room.

26:58.290 --> 26:59.750
I mean that pot of flowers.

27:03.230 --> 27:04.030
I checked into

27:04.050 --> 27:05.380
what you asked me about.

27:05.490 --> 27:07.250
Guo Xiangling was married before.

27:07.250 --> 27:08.730
She didn't lie about that.

27:10.660 --> 27:12.900
But she also has a daughter,

27:13.860 --> 27:15.590
who is that classmate of yours,

27:15.940 --> 27:16.730
Zhou Wan.

27:20.660 --> 27:21.590
What did you say?

27:23.450 --> 27:24.420
I'm telling you Zhou Wan

27:24.420 --> 27:26.750
is Guo Xiangling's biological daughter.

27:30.620 --> 27:31.380
I have to say,

27:31.380 --> 27:33.180
these two are really something.

27:33.180 --> 27:35.110
To think they would use this method

27:35.180 --> 27:36.780
to join our family together.

27:37.450 --> 27:38.340
One moment of carelessness,

27:38.340 --> 27:39.460
and both you and your dad

27:39.460 --> 27:41.660
fell into their trap.

27:50.250 --> 27:51.910
She's not that kind of person.

27:52.860 --> 27:54.190
Not that kind of person?

27:55.450 --> 27:57.340
If she wasn't,
why would she lie to you like this?

27:57.340 --> 27:58.450
God knows what she and Guo Xiangling

27:58.450 --> 27:59.780
are plotting together.

28:01.690 --> 28:03.260
This coffee is terrible.

28:04.100 --> 28:05.970
I'll bring you some good beans later.

28:05.970 --> 28:06.490
See you.

28:22.150 --> 28:22.790
Zhou Wan.

28:23.780 --> 28:24.250
Is this

28:24.250 --> 28:25.980
the secret you've been hiding?

28:27.180 --> 28:28.290
Then why did you help me

28:28.290 --> 28:29.890
deliver my portfolio today?

29:00.970 --> 29:02.970
Dr. Chen, you're not off work yet?

29:03.380 --> 29:04.010
Wan.

29:04.900 --> 29:06.230
I have good news for you.

29:06.970 --> 29:08.770
The surgery has been scheduled.

29:10.340 --> 29:11.380
Thank you, Dr. Chen.

29:11.380 --> 29:12.910
-It’s nothing.
-Thank you.

29:12.940 --> 29:13.420
Thank you.

29:13.420 --> 29:14.620
But now you need to

29:14.620 --> 29:16.380
pay a portion of the fee in advance.

29:16.380 --> 29:17.770
If you have time,

29:18.010 --> 29:18.900
you can come over
tomorrow or the day after

29:18.900 --> 29:20.380
to do the paperwork.

29:20.940 --> 29:21.900
I also know

29:21.940 --> 29:23.940
this amount might be a bit of a burden

29:24.010 --> 29:25.210
for your family.

29:25.730 --> 29:26.450
It's fine.

29:27.580 --> 29:28.780
I already have a plan.

29:29.900 --> 29:31.250
If you really have difficulties,

29:31.250 --> 29:32.140
just tell me.

29:32.490 --> 29:34.210
We will readjust the plan

29:34.450 --> 29:35.340
and continue with

29:35.340 --> 29:37.000
the conservative treatment.

29:39.180 --> 29:39.730
If the current course

29:39.730 --> 29:41.340
of treatment continues,

29:43.580 --> 29:44.580
how many...

29:46.860 --> 29:48.990
more years can my grandma stay with me?

30:02.960 --> 30:04.420
The surgery has to happen.

30:06.290 --> 30:15.670
[Wealth and Fortune]

30:12.660 --> 30:14.450
You just need to sign

30:14.450 --> 30:15.510
the loan contract.

30:15.770 --> 30:19.550
[Loan Agreement]

30:16.200 --> 30:16.860
Mr. Fang.

30:16.970 --> 30:18.180
This is the money Luo He collected

30:18.180 --> 30:18.970
last month.

30:19.780 --> 30:29.380
[Wealth and Fortune]

30:23.380 --> 30:25.100
Hurry up and get these back.

30:25.730 --> 30:26.210
Yes.

30:28.100 --> 30:28.900
Come on, guys.

30:30.580 --> 30:31.380
Get them back.

30:36.690 --> 30:38.100
How much can you lend me?

30:39.540 --> 30:40.800
One hundred thousand.

30:44.860 --> 30:46.120
Two hundred thousand.

30:48.970 --> 30:51.140
But you don't have any collateral.

30:51.820 --> 30:53.730
How can I lend you so much money?

30:57.530 --> 30:58.320
Uncle Fang.

30:59.280 --> 31:00.490
Can I call you that?

31:10.750 --> 31:12.410
My grandma came to you before.

31:12.550 --> 31:15.010
She said you were
a straightforward person.

31:16.900 --> 31:17.750
Your grandma?

31:28.620 --> 31:29.450
Huang Xuefen.

31:30.340 --> 31:31.690
You let us stay in

31:31.730 --> 31:33.930
that old factory building 10 years ago.

31:34.540 --> 31:35.340
The family that always

31:35.340 --> 31:36.870
paid off the loan with rent.

31:47.140 --> 31:49.120
Huang Xuefen is your grandma?

31:52.450 --> 31:54.330
She was a formidable woman.

31:54.620 --> 31:55.660
I remember her.

31:57.050 --> 31:58.070
Back then,

31:58.580 --> 31:59.210
before I

31:59.210 --> 32:00.830
made a name for myself,

32:01.380 --> 32:02.900
she gave me a meal.

32:03.530 --> 32:04.860
So back then,

32:04.860 --> 32:05.770
I left

32:05.770 --> 32:06.970
the house for you.

32:10.180 --> 32:11.480
You are loyal.

32:12.160 --> 32:14.220
My grandma and I are trustworthy too.

32:14.940 --> 32:16.630
If I weren't in real trouble,

32:17.480 --> 32:19.640
I wouldn't have come to you again.

32:27.940 --> 32:28.580
Okay.

32:29.900 --> 32:31.820
We'll go with your number.

32:32.150 --> 32:33.300
Think it through.

32:33.420 --> 32:35.420
Sign the contract and bring it to me.

32:35.450 --> 32:36.610
I still have to show some respect

32:36.610 --> 32:37.720
for Fen.

32:45.270 --> 32:47.430
[Loan Agreement]

32:48.040 --> 32:50.490
[Loan Agreement]

33:19.490 --> 33:20.530
By the way, Ms. Chen,

33:20.530 --> 33:21.770
where is my painting?

33:22.860 --> 33:24.530
Xixiao saw it when he came the other day.

33:24.530 --> 33:25.660
I asked him if he still wanted it kept.

33:25.660 --> 33:27.490
He just took it without saying a word.

33:27.490 --> 33:28.250
He saw it?

33:40.180 --> 33:41.310
Where are you going?

33:46.290 --> 33:47.890
My grandma is not doing well.

33:48.340 --> 33:50.000
I want to go home for a few days.

33:52.380 --> 33:53.840
Isn't she in the hospital?

33:55.050 --> 33:56.180
She was discharged.

33:57.340 --> 33:59.740
She was discharged even though she's sick?

34:03.900 --> 34:05.300
Did I say you could leave?

34:10.130 --> 34:12.590
I just don't want
to live here anymore, okay?

34:15.070 --> 34:16.070
That's not right.

34:17.699 --> 34:19.170
You gave up so easily.

34:21.940 --> 34:24.070
You don't want to be my sister anymore?

34:25.940 --> 34:28.270
You don't want to
keep trying to please me?

34:30.820 --> 34:32.820
Don't you already know everything?

34:39.310 --> 34:41.770
Because there are things
I still don't know.

34:45.050 --> 34:46.170
You can tell me.

34:48.130 --> 34:49.380
As long as you tell me yourself,

34:49.380 --> 34:50.530
I won't blame you.

34:55.170 --> 34:56.699
I've said all I need to say.

35:08.820 --> 35:10.670
[Open]

35:28.300 --> 35:29.230
Hey, beautiful.

35:30.700 --> 35:31.610
You didn't answer my calls.

35:31.610 --> 35:32.540
What's going on?

35:33.130 --> 35:34.380
My boss asked me to ask you,

35:34.380 --> 35:35.450
have you thought about it?

35:35.450 --> 35:37.090
I'll tell you when I've made up my mind.

35:37.090 --> 35:38.490
Zhou Wan, let me tell you,

35:38.530 --> 35:40.740
you are not in charge here.

35:41.640 --> 35:42.370
By tomorrow,

35:42.970 --> 35:44.010
I need an answer.

35:44.010 --> 35:44.740
Hear me?

35:45.320 --> 35:45.950
Zhou Wan.

35:47.570 --> 35:48.340
Zhou Wan.

35:50.340 --> 35:50.740
I can't

35:50.740 --> 35:52.300
wait to see

35:52.300 --> 35:54.560
what happens when you fall into my hands.

35:54.610 --> 35:55.170
You should know...

35:55.170 --> 35:57.940
Luo He, you haven't
had enough beatings, have you?

35:57.940 --> 35:59.820
How dare you speak to my boss like that?

35:59.820 --> 36:00.300
Lu Xixiao.

36:00.300 --> 36:01.380
Are you crazy?

36:01.380 --> 36:02.420
Why are you everywhere?

36:02.420 --> 36:03.300
Stalker.

36:03.970 --> 36:04.860
Let me tell you,

36:04.970 --> 36:07.380
I didn't start it this time...

36:07.530 --> 36:09.260
He's just here to collect rent.

36:09.570 --> 36:10.830
I'm going back to work.

36:13.530 --> 36:14.260
Avoiding me?

36:15.860 --> 36:16.380
No.

36:16.380 --> 36:18.240
I'm just going to be late for work.

36:22.820 --> 36:23.550
Avoiding me?

36:23.650 --> 36:24.490
Stalker.

36:26.130 --> 36:27.530
What do you want with her?

36:33.130 --> 36:34.060
You want to know?

36:36.380 --> 36:37.660
None of your business.

36:47.090 --> 36:48.610
If you really want to know,

36:49.090 --> 36:50.450
you have to pay a price.

36:54.490 --> 36:56.090
Are you negotiating with me?

36:57.040 --> 36:59.040
Then there's nothing to talk about.

37:00.940 --> 37:01.650
Whatever.

37:04.310 --> 37:05.800
Let's make a bet.

37:06.340 --> 37:07.170
You name it.

37:07.900 --> 37:09.030
If I win, you tell me.

37:09.420 --> 37:10.340
If I lose,

37:11.050 --> 37:12.510
I'll do whatever you want.

37:14.660 --> 37:15.530
You said it.

37:18.530 --> 37:20.960
Come on! Come on! Come on!

37:23.010 --> 37:23.980
Come on!

37:24.300 --> 37:25.900
What are you looking at, kid?

37:26.300 --> 37:27.160
Get him.

37:34.420 --> 37:35.050
Score.

37:36.050 --> 37:36.820
Nice shot!

37:37.050 --> 37:37.860
Nice shot!

37:39.490 --> 37:40.830
Go!

37:47.860 --> 37:49.120
You're still playing?

37:49.420 --> 37:50.730
A fight broke out at the basketball court.

37:50.730 --> 37:51.090
What kind of fight?

37:51.090 --> 37:51.940
Luo He and Lu Xixiao...

37:51.940 --> 37:53.610
-face off on the basketball court.
-Isn't Luo He the guy who beats people up?

37:53.610 --> 37:55.900
-Yeah. Go and have a look.
-What's he doing playing basketball?

37:55.900 --> 37:56.760
Okay, let's go.

38:04.300 --> 38:04.970
I need to take some time off.

38:04.970 --> 38:05.500
Go ahead.

38:05.740 --> 38:06.470
Take it easy.

38:07.530 --> 38:10.650
Come on! Come on! Come on!

38:10.650 --> 38:12.120
Foul!

38:12.300 --> 38:14.040
-Go! Go!
-Give it to me.

38:14.070 --> 38:15.700
Come on! Come on!

38:16.890 --> 38:18.010
What does that mean?

38:18.010 --> 38:18.490
Well.

38:18.490 --> 38:19.700
-What does that mean?
-What does that mean?

38:19.700 --> 38:21.530
What? A foul!

38:21.650 --> 38:24.260
-No. How was that a foul?
-I don't think so.

38:24.610 --> 38:26.010
Come on! Come on! Come on!

38:26.780 --> 38:28.890
Come on! Come on! Come on!

38:28.920 --> 38:31.110
Come on! Come on! Come on!

38:31.140 --> 38:33.980
Come on! Come on! Come on!

38:42.640 --> 38:43.790
Isn't that a foul?

38:47.820 --> 38:48.880
What are you doing?

38:49.650 --> 38:50.570
Are you okay, Ping?

38:50.570 --> 38:51.220
I'm fine.

38:51.220 --> 38:52.300
Uncle.

38:53.490 --> 38:54.550
Are you okay, Ping?

38:55.130 --> 38:55.860
-I'm done.
-Are you hurt?

38:55.860 --> 38:56.820
Playing dirty, huh?

38:56.820 --> 38:58.280
Not calling a foul on that?

38:59.130 --> 39:00.170
Why play so dirty?

39:00.170 --> 39:01.020
It's fine.

39:01.260 --> 39:02.070
Is that it?

39:03.970 --> 39:05.030
We're here to play.

39:05.720 --> 39:06.340
Let's just play for now.

39:06.340 --> 39:08.140
We'll talk about the rest later.

39:10.130 --> 39:10.860
Come on! Let's go!

39:10.860 --> 39:13.420
Come on! Come on! Come on!

39:14.420 --> 39:16.900
Come on! Come on! Come on!

39:16.920 --> 39:18.300
Come on.

39:19.800 --> 39:21.310
[Life Never Stops, Neither Does Exercise]

39:20.300 --> 39:22.290
Jiang Fan, great!

39:29.850 --> 39:30.670
[Go all out] [Lu Xixiao, the MVP]

39:42.210 --> 39:43.850
[Bravehearts versus Luo He's Team]

39:43.870 --> 39:45.550
[Victory]

39:46.220 --> 39:47.600
First half is over.

39:52.340 --> 39:53.400
In the second half,

39:53.490 --> 39:55.020
watch me destroy Lu Xixiao.

39:58.050 --> 39:59.220
What should I drink?

40:02.470 --> 40:03.160
This.

40:08.710 --> 40:09.650
What a coincidence.

40:09.650 --> 40:11.400
If it isn't our leading lady.

40:16.710 --> 40:17.790
Just play basketball.

40:17.790 --> 40:19.420
Don't resort to such low tricks.

40:19.420 --> 40:21.340
Low? How am I low?

40:22.050 --> 40:23.900
I just simply can't stand you.

40:23.900 --> 40:24.650
And that doesn't stop me

40:24.650 --> 40:26.010
from hating Lu Xixiao.

40:26.300 --> 40:28.450
Both of you

40:28.450 --> 40:29.940
won't have it easy.

40:32.170 --> 40:33.970
Why did he agree to play with you?

40:34.450 --> 40:35.180
Want to know?

40:37.900 --> 40:39.220
None of your business.

40:41.700 --> 40:42.340
Zhou Wan.

40:43.090 --> 40:44.010
I must say, you're

40:44.010 --> 40:45.790
quite pretty.

40:48.830 --> 40:49.690
Don't touch me.

40:52.090 --> 40:54.780
You're quite capable behind the scenes,

40:55.780 --> 40:57.640
charming Lu Xixiao like this.

41:02.170 --> 41:03.260
You rack your brains

41:03.260 --> 41:05.020
and this is all you come up with.

41:06.490 --> 41:07.300
Zhou Wan.

41:08.010 --> 41:09.220
Did you forget

41:09.420 --> 41:11.080
your life is still in my hands?

41:11.190 --> 41:12.120
I didn't forget.

41:14.020 --> 41:15.420
I just feel sorry for you.

41:16.490 --> 41:17.260
Because you will never

41:17.260 --> 41:18.790
beat Lu Xixiao in your life.

41:19.700 --> 41:20.780
You went to such great lengths

41:20.780 --> 41:21.450
just to beat him once

41:21.450 --> 41:23.200
on a small basketball court.

41:23.860 --> 41:24.700
But even if you win,

41:24.700 --> 41:26.560
it won't be an honorable victory.

41:26.670 --> 41:28.930
People will only
laugh at you behind your back

41:28.930 --> 41:30.060
and look down on you.

41:31.650 --> 41:32.130
Do you think

41:32.130 --> 41:32.700
I don't hit women?

41:32.700 --> 41:33.930
Bro, let it go, bro.

41:33.970 --> 41:34.530
Go away!

41:35.340 --> 41:35.940
Do you?

41:36.570 --> 41:37.570
I didn't think so.

41:38.650 --> 41:41.110
Isn't hitting girls your specialty anyway?

41:45.340 --> 41:46.420
Bro, bro, bro.

41:46.420 --> 41:47.460
Alright, alright.

41:47.460 --> 41:48.560
Enough, bro.

41:48.740 --> 41:50.400
What did you say? Say it again!

41:50.820 --> 41:51.860
Am I afraid of him?

41:51.860 --> 41:52.490
We're not afraid of him, bro.

41:52.490 --> 41:53.050
Am I?

41:53.050 --> 41:53.940
No, no.
